I agree with your apprehension of selecting applicants attending school 
during the internship period.
However, this might be a setback to the rest of the students who might have 
been able to successfully 
complete the internship(December-March) and have other commitments during 
Summer vacations (May-August).

There have been quite a few Outreachy participants in the past from my 
institute who have managed to complete their projects 
within the given timeline like Ankita Shukla 
<https://ankitashukla707.wordpress.com/2015/03/10/mediawiki-opw-an-overview-of-the-entire-journey-till-now/#more-44> (MediaWiki 
intern), two years senior to me.

This might be true for students from many other universities.

Thanks,

Aashaka
Indian Institute of Technology, Roorkee

